WEBVTT

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:30.005
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:33.863
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:01:57.549 --> 00:01:59.381
Defend the north
gate to the last man!

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:01.681
Evacuate the women
and children to Tarba!

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:04.689
Damn it! If they hadn't
attacked so suddenly...!

00:02:05.824 --> 00:02:08.316
This is no time to be
feeling sorry for ourselves!

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.692
What we have to do now is--

00:02:23.942 --> 00:02:26.240
Fall back! We're falling
back to Tarba, too!

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:30.009
Cecil! We can still fight!

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.808
The Z2axon free army will
never live down this disgrace...

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:34.944
...if we let this village burn!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:39.184
And I'll never be able to face
Slayn or Parn if I let you all die!

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:42.352
Listen, we may have
lost this battle...

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:45.522
...but we'll end up
winning the war!

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:47.797
Never forget that!

00:02:49.935 --> 00:02:53.599
Damn you, Raster! You actually
joined forces with the Marmo!

00:02:55.641 --> 00:03:00.374
The fires of a new war have begun
to ignite on the island of Lodoss.

00:03:00.913 --> 00:03:04.281
Duke Raster, the noble of Alania who
has continually fomented internal...

00:03:04.349 --> 00:03:07.375
...wars has formed an alliance with
the Marmo and has begun...

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:11.412
...to secure all the land
in Alania for himself.

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:15.793
Those damned Zaxon peasants
have caused me too much trouble!

00:03:16.995 --> 00:03:21.831
Still, why didn't I think of
this before? It's so simple.

00:03:22.668 --> 00:03:25.933
But will history
forgive us for this?

00:03:26.004 --> 00:03:28.598
Taking control of Alania is
one thing but some might say...

00:03:28.674 --> 00:03:33.942
...allying with the dark island of
Marmo is sheer madness!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.815
Are you criticizing me?!

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:42.377
|, Raster?!
The future king of all Lodoss?!

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:48.021
Yes! Once I take control of
Lodoss, a new king shall arise!

00:03:59.171 --> 00:04:03.438
80, this is the city of Hiruto.
The very picture of a castle town.

00:04:12.417 --> 00:04:16.376
I'd never expect to see such a lively
town in the middle of the desert.

00:04:16.455 --> 00:04:19.618
| can believe this is Flaim's
second-largest city.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:25.456
Yeah, and we may find some info
on those fleeing Dark Elves here.

00:04:28.867 --> 00:04:31.302
Lady Neese, what's wrong?

00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:39.807
The gods led me here...
I'm following a dark nightmare.

00:04:43.382 --> 00:04:47.148
A dark nightmare... And she
won't say any more about it.

00:04:47.719 --> 00:04:50.313
But why is this young girl
traveling by herself?

00:04:52.724 --> 00:04:58.128
Let's quit jabbering here and find
some place to rest, Captain Spark!

00:04:58.297 --> 00:05:01.130
To rest?! What are you
talking about, Leaf?!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.396
We still have an important
mission to accomplish!

00:05:03.535 --> 00:05:07.768
However, getting rest is
also a warrior's duty, Spark.

00:05:07.906 --> 00:05:09.897
Greevus is totally right!

00:05:09.975 --> 00:05:11.443
Right, Neese?

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:14.878
Hm? Oh... Well, I...

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:19.882
| guess you're right. Okay, first
let's find an inn where we can rest.

00:05:20.085 --> 00:05:24.454
All right! I can finally say
goodbye to roughing it!

00:05:25.357 --> 00:05:27.689
After that, I'll go to
see Governor Randal.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.830
Spark, you need some rest, too.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.055
C'mon, let's relax a little.

00:05:34.132 --> 00:05:37.898
No, I want to recover the stolen
implement as soon as I can.

00:05:38.637 --> 00:05:40.731
That's my mission, after all!

00:05:40.806 --> 00:05:43.537
Still, I doubt clever thieves
will hang onto...

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:45.441
...that treasure for very long...

00:05:52.484 --> 00:05:54.213
I'm knight in training Spark.

00:05:54.286 --> 00:05:56.584
I've been ordered to deal
with a band of thieves.

00:06:04.296 --> 00:06:06.355
I'm Randal, the royal
governor of Hiruto.

00:06:06.431 --> 00:06:09.128
I've heard of you.
You got out of a trap...

00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:12.262
...set by the Dark Elves
in the southern fortress.

00:06:12.604 --> 00:06:16.131
Yes... But the thieves still
managed to get away.

00:06:17.042 --> 00:06:20.672
In any case, I've stationed soldiers
around the city's perimeter.

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:23.340
We've caught nothing
in the dragnet so far, but...

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.848
Is something wrong, sir?

00:06:26.918 --> 00:06:30.013
That's right, you wouldn't
have heard about it yet.

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:33.023
Marmo and Alania
have joined forces.

00:06:33.091 --> 00:06:35.116
What?! You mean...!

00:06:35.193 --> 00:06:38.026
We're at war. King Kashue
has already ordered...

00:06:38.096 --> 00:06:40.758
...the entire army
of Flaim into battle.

00:06:43.302 --> 00:06:45.999
King Kashue himself set out
to Alania

00:06:46.071 --> 00:06:48.768
with the first battalion
to command it.

00:06:49.441 --> 00:06:53.844
We in Hiruto sent out 100
knights and 500 foot soldiers.

00:06:53.912 --> 00:06:57.542
Because of that,
we can't give you full support.

00:06:57.616 --> 00:06:59.983
We will, however, do what we can.

00:07:00.052 --> 00:07:02.487
We're finally
at war with the Marmo...

00:07:02.554 --> 00:07:05.546
And at an important time
like this, I'm stuck here...!

00:07:06.391 --> 00:07:08.120
I know how you feel.

00:07:08.193 --> 00:07:11.720
I served as King Kashue's
adjutant in the War of Heroes...

00:07:11.797 --> 00:07:14.960
...and was prepared
to face the Marmo again.

00:07:15.567 --> 00:07:20.198
But a royal governor's duties
prevent him from going to war!

00:07:20.272 --> 00:07:21.797
Governor Randal...

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:25.570
However, Spark, no matter
where you are or who you're with...

00:07:25.644 --> 00:07:29.012
...battle will find YOU.
Do you understand?

00:07:29.848 --> 00:07:31.145
Yes, sir.

00:07:34.353 --> 00:07:38.381
Spark really didn't have to
put us up in such a nice inn!

00:07:38.457 --> 00:07:40.619
He's really taking
a long time.

00:07:40.692 --> 00:07:42.922
I'm sure he must be tired, too.

00:07:42.994 --> 00:07:44.086
You're right...

00:07:46.765 --> 00:07:49.632
Wow, you gals got a really
nice room, didn't you?

00:07:49.701 --> 00:07:50.634
What's with you?!

00:07:50.702 --> 00:07:53.330
You're supposed to knock before
coming into a lady's room!

00:07:53.805 --> 00:07:57.002
Sorry. The only manners
I know are merc's manners!

00:07:59.578 --> 00:08:02.878
Leaf, could you leave the room?
You, too, Neese.

00:08:04.783 --> 00:08:08.720
| wanna teach Ryna here
about mercenary manners.

00:08:11.556 --> 00:08:13.217
Why do we have
to leave the room...

00:08:13.291 --> 00:08:15.851
...for you to teach her about
mercenary manners?!

00:08:16.995 --> 00:08:18.724
You...!

00:08:18.797 --> 00:08:20.231
Garrack!

00:08:21.199 --> 00:08:26.296
Okay, first hand over that
nasty little friend of yours.

00:08:31.276 --> 00:08:34.268
Aren't you going to teach me
about mercenary manners?

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:38.307
If you were a real merc,
I'd be happy to

00:08:38.383 --> 00:08:40.078
teach you everything I know.

00:08:40.585 --> 00:08:43.816
However, I don't do
the same for thieves!

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:52.690
Boy, he really ticks me of !
He treats people like little kids!

00:08:52.764 --> 00:08:56.200
And a Half-EIf like me will
live a lot longer than he will!

00:08:56.902 --> 00:09:00.065
I'll bet Garrack's just
got the hots for Ryna!

00:09:00.605 --> 00:09:01.766
Right, Neese?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:05.708
Hm? Oh, I really wouldn't know.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.675
Wanna go see?

00:09:10.749 --> 00:09:13.684
Huh? Go see what?

00:09:13.752 --> 00:09:15.720
The course of love!

00:09:15.787 --> 00:09:18.484
You know you want to.
You want to, right?

00:09:18.557 --> 00:09:19.683
Okay, that's settled!

00:09:19.758 --> 00:09:21.886
Uh, Leaf...?

00:09:27.132 --> 00:09:30.329
| thought I heard Lady Neese
and Leaf talking in here.

00:09:30.802 --> 00:09:33.499
The young ladies have
gone to see for themselves.

00:09:33.772 --> 00:09:36.173
The course of love...

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.811
| just want you to tell me.

00:09:40.879 --> 00:09:43.610
What are you after,
getting this close to us?

00:09:43.682 --> 00:09:45.116
What am I after...?

00:09:45.183 --> 00:09:47.914
If you're looking for a guide or to
share traveling expenses, that's okay.

00:09:47.986 --> 00:09:52.719
But if you're up to anything
else, you'd better run now.

00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:55.158
If you wanna keep living...

00:09:56.962 --> 00:10:01.866
I'm after only one thing: revenge
against the ones who killed Randy.

00:10:01.933 --> 00:10:04.334
You really expect me
to believe that?

00:10:04.402 --> 00:10:08.134
If you saw your lover get killed
before your eyes, you would.

00:10:13.845 --> 00:10:18.078
Besides, if I ran off, I'd be
betraying the code of the thieves.

00:10:20.685 --> 00:10:22.813
I'm sorry I doubted you.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.151
Thank you.

00:10:26.224 --> 00:10:30.161
But, if you try and betray us...

00:10:30.228 --> 00:10:33.391
...I'll bury that dagger
into your own chest!

00:10:33.999 --> 00:10:35.865
I'll keep that in mind.

00:10:35.934 --> 00:10:38.426
See you. Get some rest.

00:10:39.304 --> 00:10:40.465
Wait a minute!

00:10:41.907 --> 00:10:43.932
Now I want YOU
to answer a question.

00:10:44.843 --> 00:10:47.608
You aren't just
a mercenary, are you?

00:10:54.619 --> 00:10:57.316
Just who are you, Garrack?

00:10:58.423 --> 00:11:00.653
What are you talking about?!

00:11:00.725 --> 00:11:03.422
Do I look like anything
other than a mercenary?

00:11:03.495 --> 00:11:06.658
Oh, I'm not saying
I don't trust you...

00:11:07.933 --> 00:11:10.402
But I don't want to see
Spark get betrayed, either!

00:11:14.773 --> 00:11:17.333
The others don't need
to know about this.

00:11:17.642 --> 00:11:20.339
Keeping secrets among allies
is part of the thieves' code.

00:11:22.047 --> 00:11:25.210
What are they talking about?
I can't hear them clearly.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.181
Are you sure we
should be doing this?

00:11:28.253 --> 00:11:31.245
Sure I'm sure! Serves him
right for kicking us out!

00:11:33.058 --> 00:11:35.390
Okay, we can peek
in through there.

00:11:36.227 --> 00:11:37.888
Let's decide.

00:11:37.963 --> 00:11:39.522
Decide?

00:11:40.165 --> 00:11:41.530
Yeah.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:46.265
One of us holds the other on her
shoulders while they peek inside.

00:11:46.805 --> 00:11:48.830
80, who gets to do the peeking?

00:11:48.907 --> 00:11:50.272
B- But...

00:11:50.342 --> 00:11:52.709
We'll decide using this so
there's no complaining!

00:11:53.578 --> 00:11:54.568
Right...

00:11:58.249 --> 00:12:00.411
Oh, and don't use magic, either!

00:12:00.485 --> 00:12:01.953
| understand.

00:12:07.626 --> 00:12:08.559
This one!

00:12:08.627 --> 00:12:09.992
Lady Neese!

00:12:10.061 --> 00:12:11.495
Aldonova.

00:12:11.563 --> 00:12:15.227
What are you doing, Lady Neese?
Why are you here?

00:12:16.067 --> 00:12:17.660
Were you interested, too, Aldo?

00:12:17.736 --> 00:12:20.762
About Garrack and Ryna's
suspicious relationship?

00:12:20.839 --> 00:12:22.603
Suspicious...?!

00:12:23.308 --> 00:12:25.140
Lady Neese, come with
me right now!

00:12:26.845 --> 00:12:29.644
Hey, but we haven't
finished yet!

00:12:29.814 --> 00:12:32.374
A nobleman?! You are?

00:12:32.817 --> 00:12:34.649
Oh, don't give me that look.

00:12:34.719 --> 00:12:36.813
Look at my face and personality.

00:12:36.888 --> 00:12:39.550
Can't you tell I'm not
exactly a model nobleman?

00:12:40.659 --> 00:12:43.151
Come to think of it,
I've heard of guys like you.

00:12:43.228 --> 00:12:45.162
A lot of people have
mentioned overseers...

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:47.198
...charged with watching
the mercenaries.

00:12:47.265 --> 00:12:50.235
I've also heard rumors
that they kill mercs...

00:12:50.301 --> 00:12:53.271
...who break the law or
collaborate with the enemy.

00:12:54.239 --> 00:12:56.173
Well, it's not too unusual...

00:12:56.241 --> 00:12:59.142
...for soldiers to just
vanish on the battlefield.

00:12:59.811 --> 00:13:02.337
And you do that, Garrack?

00:13:02.547 --> 00:13:07.246
My current job is protecting
that eager young kid.

00:13:07.952 --> 00:13:09.078
Spark?

00:13:09.154 --> 00:13:10.747
Yeah.

00:13:10.822 --> 00:13:15.123
"There's a chance he could
be king of Flaim one day."

00:13:16.361 --> 00:13:19.353
"I don't want him to
waste that chance.”

00:13:19.431 --> 00:13:21.456
Those are King Kashue's
real intentions.

00:13:22.033 --> 00:13:24.730
That's the reason |
was assigned to this.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.562
It's pretty much a losing battle.

00:13:27.639 --> 00:13:30.506
Taking care of our
hot-headed young captain.

00:13:32.043 --> 00:13:33.977
But you look like
you're enjoying it.

00:13:34.045 --> 00:13:36.446
It's not easy to
leave that kid alone.

00:13:36.514 --> 00:13:39.381
Weird guy, this Spark kid.

00:13:39.718 --> 00:13:41.846
It sure looks like it.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.184
For instance, the captain
may just be fated...

00:13:44.255 --> 00:13:46.349
...to attract people
like you and me.

00:13:46.424 --> 00:13:49.018
He attracts troublesome people.

00:13:49.694 --> 00:13:52.561
Lady Neese, do you
really have to go?

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:56.560
Does Master Slayn
know about this?

00:13:56.634 --> 00:14:00.264
Yes. Both Father and Mother know.

00:14:00.338 --> 00:14:03.774
And I think they both understand
why I'm making this journey.

00:14:04.509 --> 00:14:05.999
But...!

00:14:06.077 --> 00:14:09.513
This is a problem
I must face myself.

00:14:10.215 --> 00:14:13.845
Ever since the Soul
Crystal Ball was stolen...

00:14:13.918 --> 00:14:15.079
No...

00:14:20.458 --> 00:14:24.895
My fate was decided the night
that nightmare entered my heart.

00:14:28.433 --> 00:14:31.027
| am the Doorway.

00:14:35.807 --> 00:14:40.369
That's why I must succeed.
For the sake of Lodoss...

00:14:44.315 --> 00:14:46.147
Sorry! Could you please?

00:14:48.553 --> 00:14:49.918
Thanks a lot!

00:14:49.988 --> 00:14:52.252
It's almost dinnertime!
Come home now!

00:14:52.323 --> 00:14:53.722
Okay!

00:14:54.626 --> 00:14:57.618
Lady Neese... To my eyes,
you're a normal girl...

00:14:57.695 --> 00:15:00.323
...no different
than those children.

00:15:01.299 --> 00:15:03.267
By the gods, why?

00:15:03.334 --> 00:15:07.532
Why has such a terrible fate
been decreed for this young girl?

00:15:14.579 --> 00:15:16.843
What am I doing?

00:15:17.048 --> 00:15:19.380
| can't take action as a knight...

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:22.442
...and I can't join the
battle against the Marmo.

00:15:25.857 --> 00:15:27.552
What the hell am I doing?!

00:15:33.097 --> 00:15:35.293
Spark, do something about this!

00:15:35.366 --> 00:15:36.959
You're the captain, right?!

00:15:37.035 --> 00:15:39.003
Wh- What's up?

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:42.467
Garrack and Aldo have
turned me into an outcast!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.168
This is not gonna help
build our teamwork skills!

00:15:45.243 --> 00:15:49.237
An outcast...? What are you
doing here, anyway?

00:15:49.447 --> 00:15:51.609
Your room's over there,
isn't it, Leaf?

00:15:51.683 --> 00:15:55.244
Because Garrack said he
wanted to teach Ryna...

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:58.620
...about mercenary manners
and threw me out of there!

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:02.524
It's not like I don't know what
he's REALLY teaching her!

00:16:02.594 --> 00:16:03.755
What are you talking about...?

00:16:03.828 --> 00:16:06.820
Uh, that's their
own business, okay?!

00:16:06.898 --> 00:16:09.595
I'm sure not gonna
say anything about it.

00:16:09.667 --> 00:16:12.830
I know! Why don't you order
me to check it out?

00:16:13.171 --> 00:16:14.969
You want to know, too, don't you?

00:16:15.039 --> 00:16:16.632
H- Hold on here!

00:16:16.875 --> 00:16:17.808
Ow!

00:16:17.876 --> 00:16:19.344
8- Sorry about that.

00:16:20.211 --> 00:16:22.908
Gee, you're kinda forward,
aren't you, Captain?

00:16:22.981 --> 00:16:25.040
D-D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:25.116 --> 00:16:26.345
What's all the commotion?

00:16:28.686 --> 00:16:31.849
Um, well... Nothing!
Nothing at all!

00:16:31.923 --> 00:16:34.358
Don't either of you
two worry about it!

00:16:34.425 --> 00:16:36.951
Yeah, don't worry about it.

00:16:37.028 --> 00:16:39.429
We know you and
Garrack are in love!

00:16:40.431 --> 00:16:42.058
Wh- What's that
supposed to mean?

00:16:42.133 --> 00:16:43.498
Never mind, never mind.

00:16:43.568 --> 00:16:47.732
Adult romance doesn't take
much time. Right, Spark?

00:16:47.805 --> 00:16:49.273
Don't ask me!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.672
We absolutely
did nothing like that!

00:16:51.743 --> 00:16:55.236
First of all, this muscle-
bound ape isn't my type!

00:16:55.747 --> 00:16:57.806
Well, EXCUSE ME
for not being your type!

00:16:57.882 --> 00:17:00.442
Besides, my muscles
are my best feature!

00:17:00.518 --> 00:17:02.043
Ooh, lover's quarrel already?

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.145
And you were really going
after each other just before.

00:17:05.089 --> 00:17:06.784
What's the big idea?!

00:17:06.858 --> 00:17:09.486
Shut up! It's your
fault for starting...

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.291
...irresponsible rumors
about us in the first place!

00:17:12.363 --> 00:17:15.799
Oh, yeah! Well, YOU were the one who
threw me out of my room, Garrack!

00:17:15.867 --> 00:17:17.699
So, you're saying
this is my fault?!

00:17:17.769 --> 00:17:19.760
Would you all
just cut it out?!

00:17:19.837 --> 00:17:21.601
Stop acting like
a bunch of children!

00:17:21.673 --> 00:17:23.004
Get lost.

00:17:23.074 --> 00:17:25.805
Let them do as their
hearts direct them.

00:17:25.877 --> 00:17:29.370
If you interrupt now, bad
feelings will remain between them.

00:17:34.118 --> 00:17:36.177
What am I doing here?

00:17:37.121 --> 00:17:39.283
At that moment, news that the
Dark Elves had been sighted...

00:17:39.357 --> 00:17:41.826
...to the south of Hiruto
reached Governor Randal...

00:17:41.893 --> 00:17:44.760
...who quickly dispatched
troops to track them.

00:17:44.829 --> 00:17:48.322
Upon hearing this, Spark and the
others soon joined the pursuit.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:49.992
Hurry, everyone!

00:17:50.068 --> 00:17:51.661
Are we really going?!

00:17:51.736 --> 00:17:54.068
What's the point in getting
rooms here, then?!

00:17:54.138 --> 00:17:55.037
Where's Aldo?

00:17:55.106 --> 00:17:56.505
Right here!

00:18:03.815 --> 00:18:05.408
I'm coming with you!

00:18:05.483 --> 00:18:08.282
Neese! Look, we're--

00:18:08.353 --> 00:18:12.221
No way! We won't just be
traveling now! This is war!

00:18:13.024 --> 00:18:19.054
Which means her holy magic will
be useful to us in battle. So...

00:18:19.664 --> 00:18:22.258
This is OUR fight!

00:18:23.868 --> 00:18:28.135
I know, but this
is my destiny.

00:18:28.206 --> 00:18:30.766
Which makes
it my fight as well.

00:18:31.275 --> 00:18:34.768
No matter what you say,
I'm coming with you.

00:18:46.424 --> 00:18:49.121
The other pursuit team's
probably already found them.

00:18:49.193 --> 00:18:52.925
Still, I hope I can avenge my
friend's death with my own hands.

00:18:52.997 --> 00:18:54.522
Yeah...

00:19:00.271 --> 00:19:03.434
I have to just think about
completing my mission now.

00:19:03.508 --> 00:19:04.498
Still...

00:19:04.575 --> 00:19:08.068
Don't become a man who only
lives for the duty given to him.

00:19:08.813 --> 00:19:11.783
A man who only
lives for his duty, huh...

00:19:11.849 --> 00:19:14.819
| see them! It's them!

00:19:22.827 --> 00:19:24.522
I'll go on ahead!

00:19:24.729 --> 00:19:26.219
Master Spark!

00:19:26.297 --> 00:19:29.426
Damn! We've got a captain
who's really worth protecting!

00:19:43.881 --> 00:19:46.248
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:19:46.317 --> 00:19:48.877
And now, what you've been waiting
for, the second part of the show!

00:19:56.094 --> 00:19:59.394
The weather feels so nice today!
What a perfect day for a picnic!

00:20:00.031 --> 00:20:02.432
Come and get us, Dark EIf!

00:20:02.867 --> 00:20:08.863
I shall defend Neese's cookies
and become a true knight!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.602
Want to join me
for lunch, Spark?

00:20:12.143 --> 00:20:13.633
These plums are great!

00:20:15.113 --> 00:20:16.638
What kind of mission is this?

00:20:16.714 --> 00:20:19.081
I've got those okaka rice
balls you like so much.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.676
Huh? Really?! Coming!

00:20:21.752 --> 00:20:23.618
Okaka, Okaka...

00:20:23.688 --> 00:20:25.417
Down the hatch!

00:20:26.691 --> 00:20:28.181
Big catch! Big catch!

00:20:28.259 --> 00:20:30.921
One basket of cookies, coming up!

00:20:30.995 --> 00:20:32.258
Hold it, you cookie thief!

00:20:33.698 --> 00:20:35.530
Get offa that!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.659
| won't let you have this
valuable gift basket!

00:20:37.735 --> 00:20:39.396
Grr... Let go!

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:40.130
No way!

00:20:40.204 --> 00:20:41.603
I said let go, so let go!

00:20:41.672 --> 00:20:43.333
| said no, so I won't!

00:20:50.948 --> 00:20:53.144
Oh? I wonder if
the weather report said...

00:20:53.217 --> 00:20:55.185
...it would be raining
cookies today.

00:20:59.524 --> 00:21:04.086
Oh... Why'd HE get them!
No fair! No fair! No fair!

00:21:05.696 --> 00:21:08.825
Those precious cookies!
My dreams of being a knight!

00:21:10.101 --> 00:21:11.933
Oh, the heck with this!

00:21:12.003 --> 00:21:15.439
How could this happen?!
Now I'll never get that new series!

00:21:15.506 --> 00:21:18.703
I'll be stuck as a knight
in training forever!

00:21:19.043 --> 00:21:20.101
Huh? That smell...?!

00:21:20.178 --> 00:21:22.545
Mm, the temperature's
just about perfect.

00:21:22.613 --> 00:21:25.947
This is so convenient. With the
ingredients and little dragon here...

00:21:26.017 --> 00:21:28.509
...I can bake all the cookies
| want.

00:21:28.586 --> 00:21:30.076
Thanks, little dragon!

00:21:31.422 --> 00:21:33.891
She can bake all the
cookies she wants...?

00:21:33.958 --> 00:21:37.656
Then what's the point
of this mission?! Darn it...

00:23:00.077 --> 00:23:02.171
Marfa, mother of the earth.

00:23:02.246 --> 00:23:05.341
Grant your miraculous
power to this young hero.

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:09.342
Amidst the battle to recover
the stolen crystal ball...

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:13.220
...no one noticed the approach
of another evil shadow.

00:23:14.659 --> 00:23:18.562
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.829 --> 00:23:21.662
"Nightmare...
The Creeping Dark Power."
